lot-measure-medicaid-expansion","line":84},{"title":"defeated a bill","target":"http://www.spokesman.com/stories/2018/mar/06/idaho-house-rejects-bill-to-keep-guns-away-from-do/","line":94},{"title":"infamous","target":"http://sandpointreader.com/heather-scott-sparks-new-confederate-flag-debate/","line":114},{"title":"Hillary Clinton","target":"https://www.buzzfeed.com/abbyzinman/rare-photos-historical-figures","line":118},{"title":"study","target":"https://www.healthaffairs.org/doi/abs/10.1377/hlthaff.2017.0976","line":122},{"title":"who recently announced her run","target":"https://www.boiseweekly.com/boise/city-of-boise-official-diana-lachiondo-announces-candidacy-for-ada-county-commission/Content?oid=9269074","line":168},{"title":"license plate","target":"https://www.buzzfeed.com/audreyworboys/funny-license-plates","line":174},{"title":"enact major legislation","target":"http://www.idahostatesman.com/news/business/article208024879.html","line":196},{"title":"agitator","target":"http://www.idahostatesman.com/news/politics-government/election/article102675892.html","line":196},{"title":"signed","target":"https://www.sltrib.com/news/health/2018/03/28/utah-governor-signs-medicaid-expansion-bill-now-utah-waits-to-see-if-the-feds-will-approve-it/","line":198},{"title":"points out","target":"https://www.theatlantic.com/politics/archive/2018/03/the-future-of-the-medicaid-expansion/555080/","line":198},{"title":"74% public approval","target":"https://www.kff.org/health-reform/poll-finding/kaiser-health-tracking-poll-february-2018-health-care-2018-midterms-proposed-changes-to-medicaid/","line":200}],"metadata":{"title":"These Volunteers Are Battling Idaho’s Government To Expand Medicaid","source":"https://www.buzzfeednews.com/article/annehelenpetersen/idaho-medicaid-expansion-ballot-initiative","author":["[[Anne Helen Petersen]]"],"published":"2018-04-12","created":"2026-07-10","description":"State legislators in Idaho have refused to accept federal funding that could help